{
  "assessment": "As Head of Government of Andorra, our microstate enjoys economic stability with steady growth and low inflation. However, our lack of formal alliances leaves us vulnerable, surrounded by larger European powers. We should pursue integration with the European Union to secure our long-term economic prosperity and diplomatic standing. Domestically, public mood is calm, but we should slightly increase spending on education and healthcare to boost popular approval and maintain social cohesion.",
